{"text": " Another god and fuck you, my god is more real and so I'm going to kill you. There is, this is my land, no it's my land, fuck you, I'm going to kill you. This is, you killed my brother, you killed my brother, fuck you, I'm going to kill you. Like, these are all the things that are at play, which is why this stuff is so untenable. There is, I always like to imagine where I would be in China and in beta California. And my property is on the Chinese side of this. And would I be like, oh yeah, it's fine, it's got a problem. And here's the bad answer. There is a number of years that if they go by, I would be like, yeah, this is a problem. And I would be more impressive. I lost my property and I'm telling you right now, at some point it just happened in the world. And so I mount the most catastrophic military events against China. Or shut the fuck up and move on. Now, I can't claim that I'm putting my money where my mouth is on this one. But my family, my wife's family, I believe, live in Cyprus. And some of them live in the north of Cyprus. And they literally thought, oh, I'm going to a refugee camp for the weekend. Only to 50 years later, they still don't have their property back. And there are other families that have raised kids in their houses. And sorry, fuck you, you get nothing. And it's devastating. You can still get them to start crying if you bring it up. Like, this is a real trauma in that family. And my answer is, you've got to move forward. And what do they do? They need to move forward. So do they still want to see a political solution? Yes. But are they willing to spend bloodshed? Absolutely not. So, ah, this is all so ugly and so gross and so obvious and predictable from the human being. That, I, um, I don't know how else to do it. I would fight like hell of a giant boy today. And then if enough people die, admittedly I'm going to be like, oh, God, I'm going to let it go. It's just not going to go. That's what war does. And that is specifically what Israel is trying to do. They are trying to, despite all the international pressure, we are willing to break their will and fight. And for everybody that says, well, you're just going to create more Hamas, they're like, word, then we will just kill more Hamas. And so it's like, everybody, yeah, everybody wants their, like, oh, you don't understand, you're just going to create more Hamas. And I'm like, you just don't understand, but they will just keep killing them because they have fucking had enough. So, and I'm happy. You can also talk about should Israel ever come into resistance? They ran a playbook, man. They ran a playbook. And that playbook was import, import, import, import, import. And you get political and economic power and a combination. Now, had Palestine been fighting back against that at that time, I would have been like, yeah, motherfuckers, you rolled up in their territory. They're going to feel some kind of way. I look at Britain, fighting back against Islamist extremists. Yep, I get it. I get what the Mads have dealt with. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right. It's all right.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.4, "text": " Another god and fuck you, my god is more real and so I'm going to kill you.", "tokens": [50365, 3996, 3044, 293, 3275, 291, 11, 452, 3044, 307, 544, 957, 293, 370, 286, 478, 516, 281, 1961, 291, 13, 50635], "temperature": 0, "avg_logprob": -0.21201146443684896, "compression_ratio": 1.939252336448598, "no_speech_prob": 2.5601845296541192e-11}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 5.76, "end": 10.1, "text": " There is, this is my land, no it's my land, fuck you, I'm going to kill you.", "tokens": [50653, 821, 307, 11, 341, 307, 452, 2117, 11, 572, 309, 311, 452, 2117, 11, 3275, 29