t, import.", "tokens": [50574, 400, 300, 862, 2939, 390, 974, 11, 974, 11, 974, 11, 974, 11, 974, 13, 50701], "temperature": 0, "avg_logprob": -0.3150418696512703, "compression_ratio": 1.7786259541984732, "no_speech_prob": 2.2093891386548714e-12}, {"id": 46, "seek": 16622, "start": 173.56, "end": 177.26, "text": " And you get political and economic power and a combination.", "tokens": [50732, 400, 291, 483, 3905, 293, 4836, 1347, 293, 257, 6562, 13, 50917], "temperature": 0, "avg_logprob": -0.3150418696512703, "compression_ratio": 1.7786259541984732, "no_speech_prob": 2.2093891386548714e-12}, {"id": 47, "seek": 16622, "start": 178.1, "end": 185.46, "text": " Now, had Palestine been fighting back against that at that time, I would have been like, yeah, motherfuckers, you rolled up in their territory.", "tokens": [50959, 823, 11, 632, 33030, 668, 5237, 646, 1970, 300, 412, 300, 565, 11, 286, 576, 362, 668, 411, 11, 1338, 11, 29537, 1134, 433, 11, 291, 14306, 493, 294, 641, 11360, 13, 51327], "temperature": 0, "avg_logprob": -0.3150418696512703, "compression_ratio": 1.7786259541984732, "no_speech_prob": 2.2093891386548714e-12}, {"id": 48, "seek": 16622, "start": 185.94, "end": 187.14, "text": " They're going to feel some kind of way.", "tokens": [51351, 814, 434, 516, 281, 841, 512, 733, 295, 636, 13, 51411], "temperature": 0, "avg_logprob": -0.3150418696512703, "compression_ratio": 1.7786259541984732, "no_speech_prob": 2.2093891386548714e-12}, {"id": 49, "seek": 16622, "start": 187.56, "end": 191.07999999999998, "text": " I look at Britain, fighting back against Islamist extremists.", "tokens": [51432, 286, 574, 412, 12960, 11, 5237, 646, 1970, 8571, 468, 4040, 1751, 13, 51608], "temperature": 0, "avg_logprob": -0.3150418696512703, "compression_ratio": 1.7786259541984732, "no_speech_prob": 2.2093891386548714e-12}, {"id": 50, "seek": 16622, "start": 191.28, "end": 192.24, "text": " Yep, I get it.", "tokens": [51618, 7010, 11, 286, 483, 309, 13, 51666], "temperature": 0